  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CLEAN PLATE NUTRITION AND THERAPY PROJECT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Many children with disabilities in Kenya are limited in access to therapy services and nutritious foods that can help them improve their physical, emotional and mental health. The clean plate nutrition and therapy project serves children with Autism, cerebral palsy, and Down syndrome, in Mathare slums by giving them occupational and speech therapy services for free every week. The children also get nutritious food parcels each month. You too can be part of their recovery journey by donating now.</narrative>
  </description>
